        "SRC-001101",
        "SRC-001110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City records call the project the Rowhouse Development at 1958 Latham Street: six ownership rowhome units in two three-unit buildings facing Latham Street, with a rear one-way driveway to private garages and guest parking, preserving two Heritage coast live oaks. The 2016 approval expired after a one-year extension when utility design issues kept the applicant from completing the building permit process.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-004234"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The May 2023 Council report states the developer, Jason Kim LLC, paid $229,178 in subdivision fees.",
      "src": [
